(c) Peas, strawberries and cherries in hermetically sealed containers, preserved or processed papaya, canned tomato jice, fruit syrup, fruit squash, fruit cordial, jellies,
jam, marmalade, candied crystallised or glazed fruits:
 (d) Non-alcoholic carbonated and  non-carbonated ready-to-serve synthetic beverages including synthetic syrups, sherbets, fruit bar, fruit beverages, fruit drinks,
synthetic soft-drink concentrates;
(e) Custard powder;
(f) Jelly crystal and ice-candy;
(h) Flavour emulsion and flavour paste for use in carbonated or non-carbonated beverages only under label declaration as provided in clause (13) of sub-rule (zzz) of rule 42.
